<title>AUSTRALIA: S&amp;P rates AIG Australia unit CPA AAA.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates AIG Australia unit CPA AAA.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's said it had assigned an AAA claims-paying ability rating to American International Assurance Company (Australia) Ltd.</p>
<p>The rating is underpinned by the unit's financially strong and supportive parent, American International Group Inc, which is also rated AAA, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
